title: Pin pm-cli 2026.9.5 and rename extension --explain
description: "Pin @unbrained/pm-cli and pm-ops to 2026.9.5. pm-cli now owns --explain as a global help flag, so changelog generate must expose selection diagnostics under --explain-selection instead."
