author: pi-agent
resolution: Pin @unbrained/pm-cli and pm-ops to 2026.9.5 and expose selection diagnostics as --explain-selection so changelog generate no longer declares host-owned --explain.
expected_result: "release:check and pm health --strict-exit pass on the pinned toolchain."
actual_result: "release:check exit 0 (545 tests, 100% coverage). Revert-proof: 3 tests fail against the old --explain declaration, 18 pass after the rename."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-05T18:14:27.347Z",pi-agent,"Pinned @unbrained/pm-cli and pm-ops to 2026.9.5. The date-from-version control already asserts only that the unflagged heading differs from the flagged one, so that gate stayed green. What broke is the host-flag contracts gate: pm-cli 2026.9.5 owns --explain as root-help expansion, so changelog generate now exposes --explain-selection instead. Revert-proof on test/extension.test.ts + test/host-flag-contracts.test.ts: 3 failing against the old declaration, 18 passing with the rename (exit 1 then 0)."
